Ge field.[K[2C[2B[1mWalking the[15Gfailure modes[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mHeart crashes before [38;2;177;185;249mepisode.finished[39m.[42G[22mRun[46Gis[49G[38;2;177;185;249mkind=episode[39m;[63Gthe[67Gnext[72Gsweep[78Gcloses[85Git[88G30[91Gminutes[99Gafter[105Gits[109Glast[114Gevent.[121GExplicit[130Gend[134Gwould[140Ghave[145Gbeen[150Gfaster;[158Gnothing[166Gis[169Gwrong.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mYou leave a window open for three days.[43G[22mSweep[49Gcloses[56Gthe[60Grun[64Gafter[70Gthe[74Gidle[79Gthreshold.[90GYou[94Gtype[99Gagain,[106G[38;2;177;185;249msession_id[117G[39mmatches[125Ga[127G[3mclosed[134G[23mrun,[139Gso[142Ga[144Gnew[148Grun[152Gis[155Gcreated[163Gcarrying[172Gthe[176Gsame[181G[38;2;177;185;249msession_id[39m.[193GYour[198Gconversation[211Gis[214Gcontinuous[225G—[227Gjoin[232Gon[235G[38;2;177;185;249msession_id[246G[39m—[248Gand[2C[1Beach run stays a bounded bucket. Nothing you can perceive changes.[K[2C[2B[1mA CLI with no session id and no end signal.[47G[22mSteps[53G3[55Gand[59G4,[62Ginteractive[74Gthreshold.[85GIdentical[95Gto[98Gtoday's[106Gbehavior[115Gexcept[122Gruns[127Gstop[132Gbeing[138Gimmortal.[2C[2B[1mTwo heart subagents at once.[22m Each[37Ggets its own [38;2;177;185;249mARTERIES_RUN_ID[39m from heart. Step 1 short-circuits before any shared file is touched,[135Gso they ca[146G't collide on the per-CLI po[176Gter — which is a bug [198Ghe current[209Gdesign[216Ghas[220Gand[224Gthis[229Gremoves.[2C[2B[1mWhat I'd add[22m[K[2C[2B[38;2;177;185;249mended_at[39m plus [38;2;177;185;249mmetadata.end_reason[39m ([38;2;177;185;249mepisode_finished[39m / [38;2;177;185;249midle_sweep[39m /[70G[38;2;177;185;249mexplicit[39m), [38;2;177;185;249mmetadata.session_id[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mmetadata.kind[39m.[117GAll[121Gof it fits[132Gin[135Gthe[139Gexisting[148G[38;2;177;185;249mJSONB[154G[39mcolumn[161Gand[165Gthe[169Gexisting[178G[38;2;177;185;249mended_at[187G[39m—[189Gno[192Gmigration.[2C[2BTwo things worth deciding before I build:[K[2C[2B[1mThe interactive threshold.[30G[22mI'd[34Gstart[40Gat[43G48[46Ghours.[53GIt's[58Gcheap[64Gto[67Gbe[70Ggenerous,[80Gsince[86Ga[88Gclosed[95Grun[99Gcosts[105Gyou[109Gnothing[117Gbut[121Ga[123Gjoin.[2B [3G[1mWhether a new run should record [38;2;177;185;249mmetadata.previous_run_id[60G[22m[39mwhen[65Git[68Gresumes[76Ga[78Gclosed[85Gsession.[94GIt[97Gmakes[103G[38;2;177;185;249mart trace[113G[39mable[118Gto[121Gwalk[126Ga[128Gconversation[141Gacross[148Gruns[153Gwithout[161Ga[163Ggroup-by.[173GOne[177Gfield,[184Gand[188Git's[193Gmuch[198Gharder[205Gto[208Gadd[212Gretroactively[226Gthan[231Gnow.[2B  Want me to implement this?[K[2B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GCooked for 1m 11s · 2 shells still running[39m[K[2B[48;2;55;55;55m[38;2;80;80;80m❯ [38;2;255;255;255mYes, 48 hours and record previous_run_id, then A + D and key runs by session, resume on match[39m                                                                                                                                                               [2C[2B[49mImplem[10Gnting. Starting with[31Gthe[35Grunlog[42Gcore:[10C[4Bresol[17Gtion ladder:[K[2B [3G[38;2;153;153;153mRan [1m3[22m shell commands [39m[K[1B[K[1B[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39mNow the CLI surface heart[29Gwill[34Gcall:[5C[1B[K[2C[1B[38;2;153;153;153mRan [1m1[22m shell command [5C[1B[39m[K[1B[38;2;255;255;255m●[6G[39m[K[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[52B[38;2;215;119;87m·[39m[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[52B[38;2;215;119;87m✢[18G[38;2;153;153;153m4[39m[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[52B[38;2;215;119;87m*[11G[38;2;235;159;127m…[39m[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[2C[50BNow[7Gtesting[15Git[18Gen