[2C[1B[1mTwo consequences for what we just built[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1B[1mThe shared-mount hazard dissolves.[38G[22mI[40Gwarned[47Glast[52Gturn[57Gthat[62Gconcurrent[73Gcontainers[84Gmounting[93Gone[97Grepo[102Gwould[108Gcollide[116Gon[119G[38;2;177;185;249m.arteries/runs/current-<cli>.json[39m.[154GWith[159Gsequential[170Gepisodes[179Gand[183Gone[187Gcontainer[197Geach,[203Gat[206Gmost[211Gone[215Gcontainer[225Gtouches[233Gthe[237Grepo[242Gat[245Ga[247Gtime.[2C[1BThat risk was real for option B; under C it[47Gdoesn't arise.[62GHeart assigni[76Gg [38;2;177;185;249mARTERIES_RUN_ID[39m r[96Gmains[102Gthe right belt-and-braces, but it stops being urgent.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mContainer exit becomes your best end signal.[48G[22mIt's[53Gmore[58Greliable[67Gthan[72Gany[76Ghook[81Gin[84Gthis[89Gsystem[96G—[98Gthe[102Gkernel[109Greports[117Git,[121Gand[125Gheart[131Gis[134Goutside[142Gthe[146Gcontainer[156Gwatching.[166GOn[169Gexit,[175Gheart[181Gcloses[188Gevery[194Grun[198Gbelonging[208Gto[211Gthat[216Gepisode.[225GThe[229G30-minute[239Gsweep[245Gstays[251Gas[2C[1Bthe backstop for the case where heart itself[48Gdie[52G, but[58Git should r[70Grely fire.[81G[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mWhat would change my answer[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1BIf[6Gsubtasks[15Gbecome[22Ga[24Gparallel[33Gfan-out[41G—[43Gseveral[51Gindependent[63Gsubagents[73Gworking[81Gdifferent[91Gfiles[97Gsimultaneously[112G—[114Gthen[119GB's[123Gisolation[133Gstarts[140Gearning[148Gits[152Gkeep,[158Gand[162Gyou'd[168Gneed[173Ga[175Gmerge[181Gstrategy:[191Gseparate[200Gworktrees[210Gper[214Gsubtask,[223Gthen[228Ga[230Gcompose[238Gstep[243Gthat[248Gapplies[2C[1Beach diff and re-runs verifiers. Tha[40G's[43Gr[45Gal work, and it's[63Gworth deciding whether you want it [3mbefore[23m building[117G sandbox, because A/C and B put [150Ghe contai[160Ger in [167Giff[171Grent place[182G.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BGiven[9Gepisodes[18Gare[22Gsequential[33Gand[37Gthe[41Gpipeline[50Gis[53Gstateful,[63GI'd[67Gbuild[73GC[75Gnow[79Gand[83Grevisit[91Gonly[96Gif[99Gfan-out[107Gbecomes[115Ga[117Grequirement.[2C[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GCrunched for 53s · 2 shells still running[114G[39m[K[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[K[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[2;54r[3S[r[H[52B[38;2;153;153;153m※[3G[1mrecap: [22m[3mWe've been fixing arteries' memory pipeline and run lifecycle; both suites pass and llama-server was resized to free VRAM. Next: decide whether I implement the three sandbox-related adjustments (episode/task ids on runs, mandatory assigned run [2C[1Bids, env-driven thresholds).[23m[39m[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l(B[?1000h[?1002h[?1003h[?1006h(B[?1000h[?1002h[?1003h[?1006h[?2026h[?25l[H[83C[41B[48;2;38;79;120m  [49m[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[83C[41B[K[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[2C[56BD[28C[2B                             [59;1H[57;4H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[3C[56Bo[59;1H[57;5H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[4C[56Be[59;1H[57;6H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[5C[56Bs[59;1H[57;7H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[57;8H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[2C[58B[38;2;153;153;153mPasting…[39m                  [59;1H[57;8H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[7C[56Bhttps://github.com/jayminwest/warren[2C[2B[38;2;255;193;7m⏵⏵ auto mode on[38;2;153;153;153m · [38;2;0;204;204m2 shells[39m[59;1H[57;44H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[57;45H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[44C[56Bh[59;1H[57;46H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[45C[56Ba[59;1H[57;47H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[46C[56Bv[59;1H[57;48H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[47C[56Be[59;1H[57;49H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[57;50H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[49C[56Bs[59;1H[57;51H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H