jects reached for [96Gome[100Ghi[103Gg other[111Gth[116Ga local[124Gcontainer:[135GWarren[142Goffers[149GDocker[156Gbut[160Gtreats[167Git[170Gas[173Gone[177Gof[180Gthree[186Gproviders,[197Gand[201GMission[209GControl[217Gtried[223Glocal[229GDocker[236Gand[240Gremoved[248Git.[2C[1BNeither[11Gdid[15Gso[18Gfor[22Gsecurity[31Greasons[39G—[41Git[44Gwas[48Goperational[60Gfriction[69G—[71Gbut[75Gthe[79Gpattern[87Gis[90Gconsistent[101Genough[108Gto[111Gplan[116Gfor.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BFor your [3ms[14Gated[23m threat[26Gmodel,[33Gthou[38Gh, remote VMs[52Gare worse, not better. Mission Control's sandboxes[103Gprotect ag[116Gst[119Gno[123Gi[125Gg[127Gtha[133Gatters to[143Gyou: they're[156Gyour own EC2[169Ginstance ru[181Gning[186Gy[188Gur code[196Gwith your keys.[212GWhat you[222Gant is a boundary between [249Ghe[K[2C[1Bagent and [3mthis machine[23m — your Postgres p[44Ger-auth s[54Gcket, your [38;2;177;185;249m~/.ssh[39m, your[78G[38;2;177;185;249m~/.claude[39m credentials.[101GA[103Glocal[109Gcontainer[119Gwith[124Gno[127Ghost[132Gmounts[139Gand[143Gdefault-deny[156Gegress[163Ggives[169Gyou[173Gthat.[179GAn[182GEC2[186Gbox[190Ggives[196Gyou[200Ga[202Gdifferent[212Gmachine,[221Gwhich[227Gis[230Ga[232Greal[237Gboundary,[247Gat[250Gthe[2C[1Bcost[8Gof[11Glatency,[20Gspend,[27Gand[31Gmoving[38Gyour[43Gentire[50Gmemory[57Gstack[63Gor[66Gexposing[75Git[78Gover[83Gthe[87Gnetwork.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BSo: [1mbuild [38;2;177;185;249mdocker-sbx[39m, and build it behind the provider seam.[22m The seam is wha[80G all[86Ghree proj[96Gcts[100Geither have (Warren),[122Gregret[129Gnot[133Ghaving[140G(Mission[149GControl,[158Gself-scored[170G2.5/10),[179Gor[182Gdon't[188Gneed[193Gbecause[201Gthey[206Gnever[212Gsandboxed[222Gat[225Gall[229G(Orca).[237GIt[240Gcosts[246Gyou[250Gone[2C[1Binterface[13Gtoday[19Gand[23Gbuys[28Gthe[3