[K[2C[1BSo:[7G[1mbuild [38;2;177;185;249mdocker-sbx[39m, and build it behind the provider seam.[64G[22mThe[68Gseam[73Gis[76Gwhat[81Gall[85Gthree[91Gprojects[100Geither[107Ghave[112G(Warren),[122Gregret[129Gnot[133Ghaving[140G(Mission[149GControl,[158Gself-scored[170G2.5/10),[179Gor[182Gdon't[188Gneed[193Gbecause[201Gthey[206Gnever[212Gsandboxed[222Gat[225Gall[229G(Orca).[237GIt[240Gcosts[246Gyou[250Gone[2C[1Binterface today and buys the option to add a remote VM or a microVM later wi[80Ghout[86Gouching h[96Gart[100Gor arteries.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BSources:[2C[1B- ]8;id=i1tesd;https://github.com/AgentSystemLabs/mission-control[94mAgentSystemLabs/mission-control[37G]8;;[39m—[39G]8;id=j09gni;https://github.com/AgentSystemLabs/mission-control/blob/main/daytona-hosted-removal-plan.md[94mdaytona-hosted-removal-plan.md]8;;[39m,[71G]8;id=fnpjv3;https://github.com/AgentSystemLabs/mission-control/blob/main/docs/project-sandbox-aws-flow.md[94mdocs/project-sandbox-aws-flow.md]8;;[39m,[105G]8;id=z2562j;https://github.com/AgentSystemLabs/mission-control/blob/main/docs/digitalocean-sandboxes-plan.md[94mdocs/digitalocean-sandboxes-plan.md]8;;[2C[1B[39m[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GWorked for 1m 28s · 2 shells still running[1B[39m [3G                                          [215G[38;2;78;186;101m✔ Update installed · Restart to update[1B[38;2;8;145;178m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────[48;2;8;145;178m[38;2;0;0;0m quality-assurance [49m[38;2;8;145;178m─[1B[39m❯ Consolidate these insights with what we talked about for breaking down episodes/runs from plexus to arteries so I can understand where docker-sbx fits in for security, transferring enough context into each sandbox in least privil