nts[184Gthe[188Gresult[195Gread-only.[206GThe[210Gsubtask[218Greads[224Ga[226Gfile[231Gand[235Ghas[239Gno[242Gidea[247Ga[2C[1Bdatabase exists. Writes go out through the [47Gpool as[55Gappended NDJSON — the channe[84G already exists, it jus[109Gisn't load-bearing yet.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mThe sharpest hazard in your setup[37G[22mis[40G[38;2;177;185;249m/var/run/postgresql[39m.[61GPeer[66Gauth,[72Gempty[78Guser.[84GMount[90Git[93Gso[96Garteries[105Gworks[111Ginside[118Gthe[122Gcontainer[132Gand[136Gyou've[143Ghanded[150Gthe[154Gagent[160Gyour[165Gentire[172Gmemory[179Gstore.[186GThat[191Gmount[197Gis[200Gthe[204Gsingle[211Gmost[216Gtempting[225Gshortcut[234Gand[238Gthe[242Gone[246Gthat[2C[1Bvoids everything else.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mOne real consequence for code we already changed.[53G[22m[38;2;177;185;249mlog_event[63G[39mfalls[69Gback[74Gto[77GJSONL[83Gand[87Gswallows[96Gthe[100Gfailure[108G—[110Ginside[117Ga[119Glocked-down[131Gcontainer[141Gthat[146Gwrites[153Ginto[158Ga[160Gfilesystem[171Gthat[176Gdies[181Gwith[186Git.[190GSilent[197Gtotal[203Gloss[208Gof[211Gevery[217Gsubtask's[227Gmemory.[235GThe[239Gspool[245Ghas[249Gto[2C[1Bbecome the primary write path for sandboxed runs before [38;2;177;185;249mdocker-sbx[39m is worth having.[87GTh[90Gt's item 3 in th[108Gbu[111Gld order, and it's the one I'd start on.[K[2C[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GCrunched for 3m 50s · 2 shells still running[1B[39m [3G                                            [215G[38;2;78;186;101m✔ Update installed · Restart to update[1B[38;2;8;145;178m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────[48;2;8;145;178m[38;2;0;0;0m quality-assurance [49m[38;2;8;145;178m─[1B[39m❯