Gplace[118Gindependently:[133G[3m"isolation at the run granularity, not per-task or per-session."[2C[1B[23m[K[2C[1B[1mContext is pushed in, never pulled out.[22m Thi[47G is the[55Gpiece that makes least privi[84Gege actually work. Hear[109Gbuilds the packet and runs[136Gcapillaries'[149Gretrieval[159Gon[162Gthe[166Ghost,[172Gthen[177Gmounts[184Gthe[188Gresult[195Gread-only.[206GThe[210Gsubtask[218Greads[224Ga[226Gfile[231Gand[235Ghas[239Gno[242Gidea[247Ga[2C[1Bdatabase[12Gexists.[20GWrites[27Ggo[30Gout[34Gthrough[42Gthe[46Gspool[52Gas[55Gappended[64GNDJSON[71G—[73Gthe[77Gchannel[85Galready[93Gexists,[101Git[104Gjust[109Gisn't[115Gload-bearing[128Gyet.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mThe sharpest hazard in your setup[37G[22mis[40G[38;2;177;185;249m/var/run/postgresql[39m.[61GPeer[66Gauth,[72Gempty[78Guser.[84GMount[90Git[93Gso[96Garteries[105Gworks[111Ginside[118Gthe[122Gcontainer[132Gand[136Gyou've[143Ghanded[150Gthe[154Gagent[160Gyour[165Gentire[172Gmemory[179Gstore.[186GThat[191Gmount[197Gis[200Gthe[204Gsingle[211Gmost[216Gtempting[225Gshortcut[234Gand[238Gthe[242Gone[246Gthat[2C[1Bvoids[9Geverything[20Gelse.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mOne real consequence for code we already changed.[22m [38;2;177;185;249mlog_event[39m falls back to JSONL and[87Gsw[90Gllows the failur[108G— [111Gnside a locked-down container that writes[153Ginto[158Ga[160Gfilesystem[171Gthat[176Gdies[181Gwith[186Git.[190GSilent[197Gtotal[203Gloss[208Gof[211Gevery[217Gsubtask's[227Gmemory.[235GThe[239Gspool[245Ghas[249Gto[2C[1Bbecome[10Gthe[14Gprimary[22Gwrite[28Gpath[33Gfor[37Gsandboxed[47Gruns[52Gbefore[59G[38;2;177;185;249mdocker-sbx[70G[39mis[73Gworth[79Ghaving.[87GThat's[94Gitem[99G3[101Gin[104Gthe[108Gbuild[114Gorder,[121Gand[125Git's[130Gthe[134Gone[138GI'd[142Gstart[148Gon.[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GCrunched for 3m 50s · 2 shells stil