rifie[96Gs at [38;2;177;185;249mbase_commit[39m [114Gnd[117G[38;2;177;185;249mfix_commit[39m in throwaway Workspaces[152Gentirely outside any episod[180G container,[192Gso a contain[205Gr-only a[214Gswer[219Gwouldn'[227G cover it.[K[2C[1B[3mAgainst:[12G[23mbwrap's[20Gown[24Gdocstring[34Gis[37Ghonest[44Gthat[49Git's[54G[3m"containment for accidents and reward hacking, not a security boundary against a hostile model."[151G[23mShares[158Gthe[162Ghost[167Gkernel[174Gand[178Gnamespaces[189Gmore[194Gthan[199Ga[201Gcontainer[211Gdoes.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mRun them in the episode's container, after the agent exits.[22m Same conta[74Gner, second [38;2;177;185;249mdocker exec[98G[39m(or a second[111G[38;2;177;185;249mdocker run[122G[39mon the same mounts) with [38;2;177;185;249m--network none[39m.[K[2C[1B[3mFor:[23m one[12Gboundary instead of two; verifiers see exactly[59Gthe[63Gfiles[69Gstem the agent pr[87Gduced, no p[99Gth[102Gtranslation; solves the por[131Gquestion for fr[147Ge since[155Ga service and its test share localhost [195Gnside.[K[2C[1B[3mAgainst:[12G[23mthe[16Gcontainer[26Gneeds[32Gthe[36Gfull[41Gtoolchain[51G—[53Gpytest,[61Glinters,[70Gnode[75G—[77Gnot[81Gjust[86Gan[89Gagent[95Gruntime,[104Gso[107Gthe[111Gimage[117Ggets[122Gfat.[127G[38;2;177;185;249mcheck_task[138G[39mstill[144Gneeds[150Ga[152Gnon-container[166Gpath.[172GAnd[176Ga[178Gverifier[187Gthat[192Ghangs[198Gnow[202Gneeds[208Gkilling[216Gat[219Gthe[223Gcontainer[233Glevel.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mA separate, stricter verifier container.[44G[22mFresh[50Gcontainer,[61Gmounts[68Gthe[72Gworktree[81Gread-only,[92G[38;2;177;185;249m--network none[39m,[108Gits[112Gown[116Gimage.[2C[1B[3mFor:[23m strongest — [21Ghe verifier [34Gan'[38G modify[46Gwhat it's verifying, which is a real[83Greward-hacking[98Gdefence[106Gthat[111Gneither[119Gof[122Gthe[126Gothers[133Ggives[139Gyou.[144GVerifier[153Gtooling[161Gstays[167Gout[171Gof[174Gthe[178Gagent[184Gimage.[2C[1B[3mAgainst:[12G[23mtwo[16Gimages[23Gto[26Gmaintain,[36Gsecond[43Gcontainer[53Gstart[59Gper[63Gverify[70Ground,[77Gand[81Gread-only[91Gbreaks[98Gany[102Gverifier[111Gthat[116Gwrites[123G(pytest[131Gcaches,[139Gcoverage[148Gfiles,[155Gbuild[161Gartifacts)[172Gunless[179Gyou[183Gtmpfs[189Gthe[193Gright[199Gpaths.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mHow I'd think about it[22m[K[2C[2BThe[7Gdeciding question isn't security, it's [1mwhat a verifier is allowed to be[22m.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BRight[9Gnow[13Ga[15Gverifier[24Gis[27Gan[30Garbitrary[40Gshell[46Gstring[53Gfrom[58Gthe[62Gtask[67Gspec,[73Grun[77Gin[80Gthe[84Gsame[89Gtree[94Gthe[98Gagent[104Gjust[109Gwrote.[116GThat[121Gmeans[127Ga[129Gverifier[138Gcan[142Gbe[145Gedited[152Gby[155Gthe[159Gagent[165G—[167Gif[170G[38;2;177;185;249mpytest.ini[181G[39mor[184Ga[186G[38;2;177;185;249mconftest.py[198G[39mis[201Gin[204Gthe[208Gworktree,[218Gthe[222Gagent's[230Gchanges[238Gshape[244Ghow[248Git's[2C[1Bjudged. That's the[22Greward-hacking[37Gsurface, and it[53Gexists identically under bwrap, unde[90G one container,[106Gor unconfined. Only the thir[135G option touc[148Ge[151Git.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BSo:[7G[1mturn on [38;2;177;185;249mHEART_SANDBOX=bwrap-nonet[39m today[47G[22m—[49Git's[54Gfree[59Gand[63Git's[68Gwhat[73Gthe[77Gpolicy[84Gwas[88Gwritten[96Gfor.[101GThen[106Gwhen[111G[38;2;177;185;249mdocker-sbx[122G[39mlands,[129Gdecide[136Gwhether[144Gverifiers[154Gdeserve[162Gthe[166Gread-only[176Gvariant,[185Gand[189Gtreat[195Gthat[200Gas[203Ga[205Greward-integrity[222Gdecision[231Grather[238Gthan[243Ga[1B [3Gcontainment one.[K[2B  The [38;2;177;185;249m--network none[39m piece is worth keeping in mind separately: [38;2;177;185;249mrun_verifiers[39m already forces [38;2;177;185;24