ry for 1 MB.[22m It shares your[64Grepo's[71Gobject[78Gstore[84Ginstead[92Gof[95Gduplicating[107Git,[111Gso[114Gevery[120Gcommit,[128Gevery[134Gblame,[141Gevery[147G[38;2;177;185;249mgit log[155G[39mon[158Gany[162Gfile[167Gis[170Gavailable[180G—[182Gand[186Gthe[190Gmetadata[199Gcost[204Gis[207Ga[209Grounding[218Gerror[224Gagainst[232Gthe[236G35[239GMB[242Gcheckout.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mThe hardlink clone is disqualified for sandboxes[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mgit clone --local[39m hardlinks object files b[46G defaul[54G, wh[59Gch is wh[69Git looks nearly free. Bu[94G:[96G[K[2C[2Bhardlinked clon[20Gpack:  links=2   ←[39Gsame[44Ginode[50Gas your[58Grepo[2C[1Bcopied[10Gclone[16Gpack:[27Glinks=1[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThat[8Gpack[13Gfile[18G[1mis[21G[22myour[26Garteries[35Grepository's[48Gpack[53Gfile.[59GSame[64Ginode,[71Gtwo[75Gnames.[82GGit[86Gnever[92Grewrites[101Gobjects[109Gin[112Gplace,[119Gso[122Gnormal[129Guse[133Gis[136Gsafe[141G—[143Gbut[147Ga[149Gcontainer[159Gthat[164Gtruncates[174Gor[177Goverwrites[188Git[191Gcorrupts[200Gyour[205Gactual[212Grepo.[218GFor[222Ga[224Gsandbox[232Gwhose[238Gwhole[244Gpurpose[252Gis[2C[1Bc[5Gntainment, handing [25Gt a live[34Ginode into your history is[61Gexac[66Gly[69Gthe th[76Gng[82G're trying to preven[103G.[K[2C[2BSo it's worktree at 1 MB, or a full copy at 24 MB.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mWhich means: keep worktrees[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BYour[8Gpreference[19Gfor[23Ghistory[31Gis[34Gthe[38Gstrongest[48Gargument[57Gyet[61Gfor[65Gthe[69Gmechanism[79Gyou[83Galready[91Ghave.[97GAnd[101Git[104Gcomposes[113Gwith[118Gthe[122Gread-only-objects[140Gmount:[2C[1B[K[2C[1B-[5G[1mFull history[18G[22mfor[22G[38;2;177;185;249mgit log[39m,[31G[38;2;177;185;249mgit blame[39m,[42G[38;2;177;185;249mgit diff HEAD~5[58G[39m—[60Gall[64Gavailable[74Gto[77Gthe[