ace,[119Gso[122Gnormal[129Guse[133Gis[136Gsafe[141G—[143Gbut[147Ga[149Gcontainer[159Gthat[164Gtruncates[174Gor[177Goverwrites[188Git[191Gcorrupts[200Gyour[205Gactual[212Grepo.[218GFor[222Ga[224Gsandbox[232Gwhose[238Gwhole[244Gpurpose[252Gis[2C[1Bcontainment,[16Ghanding[24Git[27Ga[29Glive[34Ginode[40Ginto[45Gyour[50Ghistory[58Gis[61Gexactly[69Gthe[73Gthing[79Gyou're[86Gtrying[93Gto[96Gprevent.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BSo[6Git's[11Gworktree[20Gat[23G1[25GMB,[29Gor[32Ga[34Gfull[39Gcopy[44Gat[47G24[50GMB.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mWhich means: keep worktrees[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1BYour[8Gpreference[19Gfor[23Ghistory[31Gis[34Gthe[38Gstrongest[48Gargument[57Gyet[61Gfor[65Gthe[69Gmechanism[79Gyou[83Galready[91Ghave.[97GAnd[101Git[104Gcomposes[113Gwith[118Gthe[122Gread-only-objects[140Gmount:[2C[1B[K[4C[1B[1mFull history[22m for [38;2;177;185;249mgit log[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mgit blame[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mgit di[49Gf HEAD~5[39m — all available to the agent for d[93Gbugging context[4C[1B[1mNo write access[22m — verif[29Ged [33Garlier:[41G[38;2;177;185;249mgit diff[39m/[38;2;177;185;249mstatus[39m/[38;2;177;185;249mlog[61G[39mwork,[67G[38;2;177;185;249mgit add[75G[39mand[79G[38;2;177;185;249mgit commit[90G[39mare[94Grefused[4C[1B[1m1 MB[22m of metadata per episod[33G[K[2C[1B-[5G[1mNo inode sharing hazard[29G[22m—[31Gread-only[41Gmounts[48Gcan't[54Gcorrupt[62Gwhat[67Gthey[72Gcan't[78Gwrite[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThe[7Gcopy[12Gclone[18Ggets[23Gyou[27Gthe[31Gsame[36Ghistory[44Gfor[48G24×[52Gthe[56Gmetadata[65Gand[69Gno[72Gability[80Gto[83Gwrite[89Ghistory[97Geither[104G—[106Gyou'd[112Ghave[117Gto[120Gallow[126Gwrites[133Gto[136Gmake[141Gthe[145Gclone[151Guseful,[159Gwhich[165Gputs[170Gyou[174Gback[179Gwhere[185Gyou[189Gstarted[197Gon[200Gcontainment.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mWhere that leaves the open threads