Gcontracts with four[123Gopies drift.[136GOptions, in order[154Gof[157Ghow much I'd[170Gtrust[176Gthem:[2C[2B- [1mA tiny shared package[22m bo[30Gh imp[36Grt. Honest, but it's a fifth repo or a vendored module, and[96Gneith[102Gr [105Grteries [114Gor heart currently[133Gdepends on the other.[K[2C[1B-[5G[1mheart owns it, arteries imports.[38G[22mheart's[46G[38;2;177;185;249mevents.py[56G[39malready[64Gcalls[70Git[73G"the[78Gevent[84Gspine,"[92Gand[96G[38;2;177;185;249mheart pulse[108G[39mtails[114Git.[118GBut[122Garteries[131Gwould[137Ggain[142Ga[144Ghard[149Gdependency[160Gon[163Gheart,[170Gwhich[176Gbreaks[183Garteries-without-heart.[2C[1B- [1mKeep the duplicati[25G, add[31Ga co[36Gtract tes[46G.[22m One test in each[65Grepo[70Gasserting[80Gthe[84Gsame[89Gdefault[97Gpath[102Gand[106Genv[110Gvar.[115GCheap,[122Gcatches[130Gdrift[136Gat[139GCI[142Grather[149Gthan[154Gin[157Gproduction.[2C[2BGiven the dependency di[27Gection you've deliberately [55Gvoided, I'd take the third and remove my inline fallback in [38;2;177;185;249msandbox.py:282[39m in favour of asking arteries — which[167Gthe[171Gcode[176Galready[184Gtries[190Gfirst.[2C[2B[1mMisplaced #2 — the consumer has no home yet, and it's plexus[22m[K[2C[2BEv[6Grything I[16Gbuilt generate[31G signal that nothing reads. [38;2;177;185;249msandbox.denied[39m,[75G[38;2;177;185;249mreview.notes[39m,[89G[38;2;177;185;249mscope.expanded[39m,[105G[38;2;177;185;249mpath_violation[120G[39m—[122Gall[126Greach[132Gthe[136Gjournal,[145Gall[149Gread[154Gby[157Gnobody.[2C[1B[K[3C[1Bhe consumer[16Gbelongs in [1mplexus[22m, and its[43Gown[47Gstructure[57Gsays where:[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1Bplexus.toml[21Gcharter,[30Gstanding,[40Gnever[46Gcloses[57G(spec.py)[2C[1Bta[6Gks.jsonl      [21Gclosable work i[37Gems     [46G   [50G  [53G   [57G (tasks.py)[K[2C[1BTaskSpec  [14G     [20G pe